    "title": "'The Pitt' new episode release time, schedule and how to watch",
    "text": "TVWhat time does new episode of 'The Pitt' come out? How to watch Lucas FrauNorthJersey.comApril 2, 2026, 3:00 p.m. ETIf you are hooked on the hit television show “The Pitt” get ready for a new episode on the horizon.Season 2 of the HBO show is nearing its end but the award-winning series has a new episode coming out. Here is everything you need to know about the latest release.What time do 'The Pitt' episodes come out?Episode 13 of the “The Pitt” comes out on Thursday, April 2 at 9 p.m. eastern time. New episodes air at the same time every Thursday.Where can I watch 'The Pitt'Season 1 and 2 of “The Pitt” are available for streaming on the platform HBO Max. A subscription is necessary to stream the show.Need a news break? Check out the all new PLAY hub with puzzles, games and more!The basic plan with ads costs $10.99/month or $109.99/year. Other subscription plans are available.How many episodes of 'The Pitt' are in season 2?“The Pitt” Season 2 will have 15 episodes. The finale of Season 2 is set to come out on April 16, 2026.What is 'The Pitt' about?“The Pitt” takes place in a fictional hospital in Pittsburgh. The unique series showcases the life of a nurses working a 15-hour shift. Each episode covers one hour of the shift.Who Pays the Least for Car Insurance in These Missouri ZIP Codes?Check how your ZIP code’s rates compare before renewing your policy.OTTO Insurance | AdAdUndo12 Things To Cut When Living On RetirementGreensprout | AdAdUndo12 Things To Cut When Living On Retirement IncomeGreensprout | AdAdUndoHere’s What a Fully Equipped Stairlift Should Cost You in 2026HomeBuddy | AdAdUndoTemu Clearance SaleTemu Clearance Sale, where unbeatable discounts meet your shopping needsTEMU | AdAdShop NowUndoMissouri: Say Hello To Cheap Car Insurance If You Live In These Zip CodesCheck how your ZIP code’s rates compare before renewing your policy.OTTO Insurance | AdAdUndoWhy Your Rotator Cuff Isn't Healing (It’s Not Just Age)Shoulder Relief News | AdAdUndo1